# ADR-0024: declarations are validated, and an illegal one is rejected
# with nothing changed. Bloodrock Cyclops (3/3) "attacks each combat if
# able" (S:Mode$ MustAttack | ValidCreature$ Card.Self); Iron Golem (5/3)
# "attacks or blocks each combat if able" (S:Mode$ MustBlock).
startturn human
advance 5
# CR 508.1d: declining to attack leaves the Cyclops' requirement unmet
# while an attack meeting it exists -- rejected.
queue attackers none
expecterror 508.1d declareattackers
# The Cyclops attacks; the Devoted Hero may stay home.
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
# CR 509.1c: blocking with the Devoted Hero alone leaves Iron Golem
# unassigned though it can block -- rejected.
queue blocks 4=1
expecterror 509.1c declareblockers
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
